<title>GHANA: SOCCER-GHANA BEAT ANGOLA 2-1 IN AFRICA CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GHANA BEAT ANGOLA 2-1 IN AFRICA CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>ACCRA 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ghana's Black Stars beat Angola 2-1</p>
<p>(halftime 2-1) in an African Nations Cup soccer championship</p>
<p>qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Ghana - Felix Aboagye (7th), Kim Grant (30th)</p>
<p>Angola - Antonio Alvesa (2nd minute)</p>
<p>Attendance: 34,000</p>
